  <Properties>
    <Name>(j) Bare Necessities for VP</Name>
    <Teaser>Vox Populi's Bare Necessities offer the bare necessites of Vox Populi. May download Referenced Mod for more options!</Teaser>
    <Description>Vox Populi's Bare Necessities offer the bare necessites of Vox Populi.[NEWLINE]By default, Unique Policy Buildings, More Beliefs, and More Processes are unlocked.[NEWLINE]You must activate framedarchitecture's National Wonders Collection to unlock National Wonders.</Description>
    <Authors>Techpriest Enginseer, Jarcast</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Artisanix, thecrazyscotsman, framedarchitecture</SpecialThanks>
